    "text": "Example 8 : Given that ABCD is a parallelogram,\nand suppose AD = 5 cm, AB = 7 cm (see Fig. A1.1).\nWhat can you conclude about the lengths of DC and\nBC?",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
    "document_id": "NCERT_X_MATH_JEMH1A1",
